{
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "scene_01",
      "events": [
        {
          "id": "n001",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "夜班的机房里，只剩一台终端还醒着。",
          "animation": "fade",
          "holdSeconds": 1.6
        },
        {
          "id": "d001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "连接已建立。\n远端没有立刻回答。",
          "animation": "typewriter",
          "holdSeconds": 1.3
        },
        {
          "id": "d002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "光标停在行末，像是在等你确认。",
          "animation": "typewriter",
          "holdSeconds": 1.2
        },
        {
          "id": "c001",
          "type": "choice",
          "options": [
            { "id": "continue", "text": "继续连接" },
            { "id": "disconnect", "text": "断开连接" }
          ],
          "initialOptionId": "disconnect",
          "selectedOptionId": "continue",
          "waitBeforeMoveSeconds": 0.8,
          "moveSeconds": 0.25,
          "holdAfterSelectSeconds": 0.7
        },
        {
          "id": "d003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "密钥已经发出。\n请不要关闭这个窗口。",
          "animation": "typewriter",
          "holdSeconds": 1.3
        },
        {
          "id": "n002",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "风扇忽然变慢。\n机柜顶部的灯跳成了琥珀色。\n你听见自己的呼吸。",
          "animation": "lines",
          "holdSeconds": 1.6
        },
        {
          "id": "d004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "警告：链路不稳定。\n可以切换备用通道，也可以在这里中止。",
          "animation": "typewriter",
          "holdSeconds": 1.4
        },
        {
          "id": "c002",
          "type": "choice",
          "options": [
            { "id": "backup", "text": "切换备用通道" },
            { "id": "abort", "text": "立即中止" },
            { "id": "wait", "text": "再等一会儿" }
          ],
          "initialOptionId": "wait",
          "selectedOptionId": "backup",
          "waitBeforeMoveSeconds": 0.9,
          "moveSeconds": 0.35,
          "holdAfterSelectSeconds": 0.8
        },
        {
          "id": "t001",
          "type": "transition",
          "preset": "fadeBlack",
          "durationSeconds": 0.8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_02",
      "events": [
        {
          "id": "n003",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "备用通道的灯是绿色的，噪声小了很多。",
          "animation": "fade",
          "holdSeconds": 1.6
        },
        {
          "id": "d005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "已切换。\n现在能听见我吗？",
          "animation": "typewriter",
          "holdSeconds": 1.4
        },
        {
          "id": "d006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "如果你还能改这句对白、选项和光标，第一版就达到目标了。",
          "animation": "typewriter",
          "holdSeconds": 1.6
        },
        {
          "id": "n004",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "时间轴不会跟着预览速度重排。\n要改节奏，就改配置，再生成一次。",
          "animation": "lines",
          "holdSeconds": 1.6
        },
        {
          "id": "d007",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "工程保存在输出目录里。\n素材就在旁边的 assets 文件夹。",
          "animation": "typewriter",
          "holdSeconds": 1.5
        },
        {
          "id": "t002",
          "type": "transition",
          "preset": "fadeBlack",
          "durationSeconds": 0.6
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
